From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] motor (4.4.94): thingino module-param interface, tcu_chn2 binding, switch-less heads, lifetime fixes

Backport of thingino/ingenic-sdk motor.c (4.4.94/misc/motor, lfiebach v3,
PR thingino/ingenic-sdk#11 e9b33d7d, which sits on 343ae306 + 248c8345) to
the old SDK layout pinned here (common/misc/motor):

- hst*/vst*/hmaxstep/vmaxstep/nolimits/tcu_channels... module parameters,
  of_match "ingenic,tcu_chn2"
- no gpio_direction_output() in the step interrupt (supersedes the former
  0003 step-IRQ patch)
- switch-less (limit-less) heads, devm double free, fops .owner,
  check_params y fix
---
